@startuml Tseten Angular Component and Routing
!define RECTANGLE_WIDTH 280
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam wrapWidth 250
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title Tseten Angular - Component Hierarchy and Routing
scale 0.8

skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #FCE4EC
    BorderColor #C2185B
}

skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #8E24AA
}

package "Application Root" {
    component [AppComponent] as appRoot
}

package "Routing Configuration" {
    component [Routes Definition] as routes
}

package "Public Pages (Unauthenticated)" {
    component [LoginPage] as login
}

package "Protected Pages (Authenticated)" {
    component [WorkspacePage] as workspace
    
    component [RequirementsListPage] as reqList
}

package "Reusable Components (Future)" {
    component [RequirementDetailComponent] as reqDetail
    
    component [AcceptanceCriteriaComponent] as acComponent
    
    component [CommentThreadComponent] as commentThread
}

' Routing flow
appRoot --> routes : uses
routes --> login : default route
routes --> workspace : protected
routes --> reqList : protected

' Component hierarchy
workspace ..> reqDetail : may contain
reqList ..> reqDetail : navigates to
reqDetail ..> acComponent : contains
reqDetail ..> commentThread : contains

note right of login
  **Unauthenticated Route**
  Accessible without token.
  Redirects to /workspace
  on successful login.
end note

note bottom of workspace
  **Protected Routes**
  AuthGuard checks JWT token.
  Redirects to /login if not
  authenticated.
  
  Token stored in localStorage.
end note

note left of reqList
  **Data Fetching**
  Component uses HttpClient
  directly (no separate service
  layer currently).
  
  API call in ngOnInit():
  GET /api/softwarerequirements
  
  Future: Extract to service.
end note

note bottom of routes
  **Standalone Architecture**
  No NgModules. Each component
  declares its own dependencies.
  
  Routes use function-based
  configuration: provideRouter()
end note

@enduml
